                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "36f95134-55ae-44a3-8fc3-952d0343a61f",
                        "entry_id": "4f1655cf-582c-3b1f-a96c-960ad4528724",
                        "tags": [
                            "comparative"
                        ],
                        "form": "more unreflecting"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "faf0de83-3a5b-43e9-b89c-a9dbd4e1c698",
                        "entry_id": "4f1655cf-582c-3b1f-a96c-960ad4528724",
                        "tags": [
                            "superlative"
                        ],
                        "form": "most unreflecting"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "9aa173c2-e0e3-3bbe-84d1-b66cf563fe6b",
                        "entry_id": "4f1655cf-582c-3b1f-a96c-960ad4528724",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Not giving reflection or thought to one's actions, words, conclusions, etc.; (of an action, statement, conclusion, etc.) done without reflection or thought. (of a person)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a1755dc7-457b-40fe-bf3e-07cc40075ef2",
                                "sense_id": "9aa173c2-e0e3-3bbe-84d1-b66cf563fe6b",
                                "text": "Now what Discourse can be more suited to the Principles of these young Cubs of the Leviathan, than not to punish credulous and unreflecting People for being cheated and abused?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "97e4d587-99d2-452d-b614-916629c17757",
                                "sense_id": "9aa173c2-e0e3-3bbe-84d1-b66cf563fe6b",
                                "text": "When culprit reason truant plays,\nAnd wanders forth in fancy’s maze,\nThy random shafts may please a-while,\nAnd raise the unreflecting smile,\nBut soon as absent sense returns,\nOur cheek with indignation burns,"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e0b770e4-693f-4e1f-93d9-241795ca27f3",
                                "sense_id": "9aa173c2-e0e3-3bbe-84d1-b66cf563fe6b",
                                "text": "If there are people so unreflecting or so cruel, as to make a jest of me, what is left for me to do but to make a jest of myself, them, and every thing?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7869f54e-b309-4275-b5c6-f335468b20ea",
                                "sense_id": "9aa173c2-e0e3-3bbe-84d1-b66cf563fe6b",
                                "text": "[…] there he was gallantly, thoughtlessly alive, to all appearance indestructible solely by the virtue of his few years and of his unreflecting audacity."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "32bab1d8-fd92-4a77-8071-2ee67f55ede0",
                                "sense_id": "9aa173c2-e0e3-3bbe-84d1-b66cf563fe6b",
                                "text": "How ungenerously in later life we disclaim the virtuous moods of our youth, living in retrospect long, summer days of unreflecting dissipation, Dresden figures of pastoral gaiety!"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "cd9ce176-b5f4-3e8f-8730-4e1465d15784",
                        "entry_id": "4f1655cf-582c-3b1f-a96c-960ad4528724",
                        "glosses": [
                            "That does not reflect light or sound."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b618fa21-4fdb-4322-b45b-701848939bb4",
                                "sense_id": "cd9ce176-b5f4-3e8f-8730-4e1465d15784",
                                "text": "[…] a mirror may have picturesque beauty; but it is only from it's reflections. In an unreflecting state, it is insipid."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1335e92f-afd2-4c1c-83d2-85d7c68239d9",
                                "sense_id": "cd9ce176-b5f4-3e8f-8730-4e1465d15784",
                                "text": "A star-ship—as the mirrors told—\nPut forth its great and lonely light\nTo the unreflecting Ocean, Night."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4e9a4462-d8a2-45e8-b8a9-95bf73cb4285",
                                "sense_id": "cd9ce176-b5f4-3e8f-8730-4e1465d15784",
                                "text": "The steel hat on the coffin lay blackened and unreflecting under the winter sun […]"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
